## Key Concepts
- Verifiable provenance with per-tenant keys
- Attested inference in a trusted enclave
- Region-bound data locality and KMS
- Tamper-evident audit logs and rotation

## Code Example
```javascript
// Example: sign a payload with a per-tenant key (simplified)
const crypto = require('crypto');
function signPayload(payload, key) {
  const sign = crypto.createSign('SHA256');
  sign.update(JSON.stringify(payload));
  sign.end();
  return sign.sign(key, 'base64');
}
```

